###### KITCHEN (authority: kitchen.read — ADMIN & KITCHEN) ######
### Papan antrean dapur (KDS). Read-only; transisi tetap via POST /orders/{id}/prepare|ready.
### Lihat API_CONTRACT.md §R.
###
### Default: status=CONFIRMED,PREPARING, urut TERTUA DULU (createdAt,asc), size 20 (maks 50).
### tableNumber = nomor meja dari sesi dining OPEN yang memuat order; null untuk TAKEAWAY.
### items[] = OrderItemResponse (termasuk modifiers) — sama dengan detail order.
###
### Pakai token akun kitchen@rascal.id (kitchen123) untuk request di bawah.
### Token akun lain → 403 (mis. kasir/waiter tanpa kitchen.read).

### Antrean default (CONFIRMED + PREPARING, tertua dulu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Antrean dengan ukuran lebih besar (di-cap di 50 walau minta 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders?size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hanya order yang belum di-confirm (biasanya kosong — kasir/waiter yang confirm dulu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders?status=CREATED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Satu status saja
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders?status=PREPARING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Multi-status (bentuk sama dengan GET /orders)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders?status=CONFIRMED&status=PREPARING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid status (400: "Invalid order status: 'BAKING'. Allowed: CREATED, CONFIRMED, ...")
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders?status=BAKING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Forbidden (403) — token tanpa kitchen.read
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# ganti {{token}} dengan access token akun waiter/cashier untuk melihat 403

### No auth (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/kitchen/orders

### ========================================
### MAJUKAN STATUS (endpoint yang sudah ada di §J — bukan milik kitchen.http)
### ========================================

### Mulai masak (CONFIRMED → PREPARING) — butuh order.mark.preparing
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Selesai masak (PREPARING → READY) — butuh order.mark.ready
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
